{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02592","headline":"凌晨早朝 · 虞世南","name":"凌晨早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万瓦宵光曙，重檐夕雾收。\n玉花停夜烛，金壶送晓筹。\n日晖青琐殿，霞生结绮楼。\n重门应啓路，通籍引王侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}